sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant CF as Cloudflare
    participant CY as Caddy :443
    participant NX as nginx :80
    participant BE as backend :8080

    B->>CF: TLS
    CF->>CY: adds CF-IPCountry, X-Forwarded-For
    CY->>NX: reverse_proxy frontend:80
    Note over NX: map $http_cf_ipcountry $geo_blocked<br/>EEA + IS/LI/NO + GB → 451
    NX->>NX: if ($geo_blocked) return 451
    NX->>BE: proxy_pass http://backend:8080<br/>Upgrade + Connection: upgrade<br/>read/send timeout 3600s<br/>proxy_buffering off
    BE-->>B: 101 Switching Protocols
